flowchart LR
  cfn[CloudFormation stack] --> sg[Security group]
  cfn --> role[IAM instance role]
  cfn --> ec2[EC2 WordPress instance]
  sg -. HTTP and restricted SSH .-> ec2
  role -. SSM managed access .-> ec2
  ec2 --> wp[Apache + PHP + MariaDB + WordPress]
  ec2 --> ami[WordPress AMI]
  ami --> lt[Launch template]
  lt --> asg[Development Auto Scaling group]
  health[Route 53 health check] -. HTTP check .-> ec2
